<title>UK: Capital Corp rejects London Clubs bid.</title>
<headline>Capital Corp rejects London Clubs bid.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Capital Corporation Plc said on Monday it rejected a takeover bid from British casino operator London Clubs International Plc.</p>
<p>Capital Corporation said in a statement that London Club's 'unwelcome' 181 million stg offer undervalued the company.</p>
<p>London Clubs said earlier on Monday it was offering 47 new shares in its share capital for every 100 Capital Corporation shares.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44-171-542 7717</p>
</text>
